  "items": [
    {
      "name": "Why This Happens",
      "char_file": "비강스프레이_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Nasal polyps are soft growths",
        "from long-term inflammation",
        "in your nasal and sinus lining",
        "",
        "They're more common in people",
        "with asthma, allergies, or a",
        "sensitivity to certain pain relievers"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Taking Aspirin Or Ibuprofen Freely",
      "char_file": "아스피린_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "First, taking aspirin, ibuprofen,",
        "or naproxen without knowing",
        "your sensitivity",
        "",
        "Some people have a reaction called AERD,",
        "where these drugs suddenly",
        "worsen congestion"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Ask About A Safer Pain Reliever",
      "char_file": "알약_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Talk to your doctor about",
        "acetaminophen instead,",
        "and mention any drug reactions",
        "",
        "This can help you avoid",
        "a sudden flare-up"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Breathing In Smoke And Irritants",
      "char_file": "담배_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Second, breathing in tobacco smoke,",
        "chemical fumes, or dust",
        "without protection",
        "",
        "These irritants keep the swelling",
        "and inflammation going"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Limit Airborne Irritants",
      "char_file": "공기청정기_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Try an air purifier indoors",
        "and a mask around fumes or dust",
        "",
        "Less exposure may mean",
        "less swelling over time"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Skipping Saline Rinse",
      "char_file": "긴장_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Last, skipping saline rinse",
        "and letting mucus sit",
        "",
        "Trapped mucus and irritation",
        "can keep polyps growing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Rinse With Saline Regularly",
      "char_file": "비강스프레이_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Use a saline rinse once or twice a day",
        "and run a humidifier at home",
        "",
        "This may help clear irritants",
        "and ease congestion"
      ]
    }
  ],
